# Saved/recorded LA captures for repeatable regression testing.
# The current schema is VCD (Value Change Dump) emitted by sigrok-cli.
# Files in this directory are NOT tracked by git — see .gitignore.
# To add a regression capture:
#   1. Capture from a known-good 2019A
#   2. Save the VCD with a descriptive name (e.g. stage1_known_good_20260615.vcd)
#   3. Add a regression test in harness/tests.py that loads this file
